<text>
<p>CHANGE				    CHANGE</p>
<p>TSE	 6377.84   -64.70   HI 6440.01	    LO  6377.84</p>
<p>DJI	 7322.03   -60.95   GOLD (LONDON)   US$342.80  -0.85</p>
